hadiths[9]{hadithnumber,text}:
"212","Ibn 'Umar reported that the Prophet"
"213","Ibn 'Umar reported that he heard the Messenger of Allah"
"214","Jabir ibn 'Abdullah al-Ansari reported that the Prophet"
"215","Ibn 'Umar reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"216","Anas reported that the Muhajirun said"
"217","Abu Hurayra reported that the Prophet"
"218","Abu Hurayra reported that the Prophet"
"219","Abu Dharr reported that the Prophet"
"220","Qabisa ibn Burma al-Asadi said"
